// CHAT (parse + plan): the supervisor types or pastes lines ("we finished ibl4", "sending a team to ibl5 with porfirio", "cy is sick", a pasted update)
// and they become a list of board changes to look over. Everything in this block is pure: it reads a snapshot of the board and returns what it understood
